#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:474
msgid "Nextcloud 26 or newer"
msgstr "Nextcloud 26 nó níos nuaí"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:18 ../../groupware/mail.rst:46
#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:65 ../../groupware/mail.rst:78
msgid "Visit mail settings"
msgstr "Tabhair cuairt ar shocruithe ríomhphoist"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:19
msgid "Choose between *List*, *Vertical split* and *Horizontal split*"
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh idir *Liosta*, *Roinnt ingearach* agus *Roinnt chothrománach*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:24
msgid "Use Compact Mode"
msgstr "Úsáid Mód Dlúth"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:25 ../../groupware/mail.rst:626
msgid "Nextcloud 32 or newer"
msgstr "Nextcloud 32 nó níos nuaí"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:27
msgid ""
"Compact mode offers a cleaner and more efficient way to view your messages. "
"Avatars are hidden, selection checkboxes are always visible, and the preview"
" of messages is removed. It saves space allowing you to see more emails at "
"once."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann mód dlúth bealach níos glaine agus níos éifeachtaí ar fáil chun do "
"theachtaireachtaí a fheiceáil. Tá avatars i bhfolach, tá boscaí seiceála "
"roghnúcháin le feiceáil i gcónaí, agus baintear réamhamharc na "
"dteachtaireachtaí. Sábhálann sé spás agus ligeann sé duit níos mó "
"ríomhphoist a fheiceáil ag an am céanna."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:29
msgid "Visit the mail settings"
msgstr "Tabhair cuairt ar na socruithe ríomhphoist"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:30
msgid "Go to **Appearance**"
msgstr "Téigh go dtí **Dealramh**"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:31
msgid "Toggle the Compact Mode"
msgstr "Athraigh an Mód Dlúth"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:36
msgid "Message Display / Operation Mode"
msgstr "Taispeántas Teachtaireachtaí / Mód Oibríochta"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:38 ../../groupware/mail.rst:269
#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:279 ../../groupware/mail.rst:289
#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:395 ../../groupware/mail.rst:403
#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:447 ../../groupware/mail.rst:481
#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:526 ../../groupware/mail.rst:538
#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:555 ../../groupware/mail.rst:572
msgid "Nextcloud 30 or newer"
msgstr "Nextcloud 30 nó níos nuaí"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:40
msgid ""
"Mail has the ability to switch between two different message view and "
"operation modes: *Threaded* and *Singleton*."
msgstr ""
"Tá an cumas ag Mail aistriú idir dhá mhodh éagsúla radhairc agus oibríochta "
"teachtaireachtaí: *Snáithithe* agus *Singleton*."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:42
msgid ""
"In *Threaded* mode, messages are grouped by conversation. In the folder "
"message list, related messages are stacked so only the most recent message "
"is shown, and all relates messages are shown in message display panel after "
"the stacked message is selected. This is useful for following discussions "
"and understanding the context of replies. In this mode, message operation "
"like move and delete apply to the entire thread, meaning that when you move "
"or delete a thread, all messages within that thread are affected."
msgstr ""
"Sa mhodh *Snáithe*, déantar teachtaireachtaí a ghrúpáil de réir comhrá. I "
"liosta na dteachtaireachtaí san fhillteán, cruachtar teachtaireachtaí "
"gaolmhara ionas nach dtaispeántar ach an teachtaireacht is déanaí; "
"taispeántar na teachtaireachtaí gaolmhara go léir sa phainéal taispeána "
"teachtaireachtaí nuair a roghnaítear an teachtaireacht atá sa chruach. Tá sé"
" seo úsáideach chun plé a leanúint agus chun comhthéacs na bhfreagraí a "
"thuiscint. Sa mhodh seo, baineann oibríochtaí ar nós bogadh agus scriosadh "
"leis an snáithe iomlán; is é sin le rá, má bhogann nó má scriosann tú "
"snáithe, beidh tionchar aige sin ar gach teachtaireacht atá sa snáithe sin."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:44
msgid ""
"In *Singleton* mode, messages are displayed individually, in both the folder"
" message list and message display panel and operation like move and delete "
"apply to only the selected message. This mode is useful when you want to "
"manage messages separately without affecting the entire conversation."
msgstr ""
"Sa mhód *Singleton*, taispeántar teachtaireachtaí ina n-aonar — i liosta "
"teachtaireachtaí an fhillteáin agus sa phainéal taispeána teachtaireachtaí "
"araon — agus ní bhaineann oibríochtaí ar nós bogadh agus scriosadh ach leis "
"an teachtaireacht atá roghnaithe. Tá an mód seo úsáideach nuair is mian leat"
" teachtaireachtaí a bhainistiú ar leithligh, gan cur isteach ar an gcomhrá "
"iomlán."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:47
msgid "Choose between *Threaded*, *Singleton*"
msgstr "Roghnaigh idir *Snáithithe*, *Singleton*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:52
msgid "Add a new mail account"
msgstr "Cuir cuntas ríomhphoist nua leis"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:54
msgid "Enable mail app from the apps"
msgstr "Cumasaigh feidhmchlár ríomhphoist ó na haipeanna"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:55
msgid "Click the mail icon on the header"
msgstr "Cliceáil ar an deilbhín ríomhphoist ar an gceanntásc"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:56
msgid "Fill up the login form (auto or manual)"
msgstr "Líon suas an fhoirm logáil isteach (uathoibríoch nó lámhleabhar)"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:61
msgid "Change sort order"
msgstr "Athraigh ord sórtála"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:66
msgid "Go to *Sorting*"
msgstr "Téigh go dtí *Sórtáil*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:67
msgid "You can choose *Oldest* or *Newest* mail first"
msgstr "Is féidir leat ríomhphost *Is sine* nó *is Déanaí* a roghnú ar dtús"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:69
msgid "This change will apply across all your accounts and folders"
msgstr "Beidh feidhm ag an athrú seo ar fud do chuntas agus d’fhillteán uile"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:72
msgid "Sort favorites up"
msgstr "Sórtáil na cinn is fearr leat suas"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:74
msgid "Nextcloud 31 or newer"
msgstr "Nextcloud 31 nó níos nuaí"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:76
msgid ""
"This setting allows you to show messages set as favorite in a separate "
"section on top of the message list."
msgstr ""
"Leis an socrú seo, is féidir leat teachtaireachtaí atá socraithe mar is "
"fearr leat a thaispeáint i rannóg ar leithligh ag barr an liosta "
"teachtaireachtaí."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:79
msgid "Go to *Appearance*"
msgstr "Téigh go *Dealramh*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:80
msgid "Enable sorting favorites up"
msgstr "Cumasaigh sórtáil na bhfear is fearr leat suas"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:85
msgid "Scheduled messages"
msgstr "Teachtaireachtaí sceidealaithe"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:86 ../../groupware/mail.rst:247
msgid "Click the **New message** button"
msgstr "Cliceáil an cnaipe **Teachtaireacht nua**"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:87
msgid "Click the (...) action menu on the modal composer"
msgstr "Cliceáil ar an roghchlár gníomhaíochta (...) ar an gcumadóir módúil"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:88
msgid "Click *send later*"
msgstr "Cliceáil *seol níos déanaí*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:93
msgid "Priority inbox"
msgstr "Bosca isteach tosaíochta"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:94
msgid ""
"Priority inbox has 2 section *Important* and *Others*. Messages will "
"automatically be marked as important based on which messages you interacted "
"with or marked as important. In the beginning you might have to manually "
"change the importance to teach the system, but it will improve over time."
msgstr ""
"Tá 2 roinn *Tábhachtach* agus *Eile* sa bhosca isteach tosaíochta. Déanfar "
"teachtaireachtaí a mharcáil go huathoibríoch mar thábhachtach, bunaithe ar "
"na teachtaireachtaí a ndearna tú idirghníomhú leo nó a mharcáil tú a bheith "
"tábhachtach. Ar dtús b'fhéidir go mbeadh ort an tábhacht a bhaineann leis an"
" gcóras a mhúineadh a athrú de láimh, ach feabhsóidh sé le himeacht ama."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:97
msgid ""
"The automatic classification is optional. You can opt-out when setting up an"
" account. The classification can also be turned on and off in the account "
"settings at any time."
msgstr ""
"Is rogha é an t-aicmiú uathoibríoch. Is féidir leat rogha an diúltaithe a "
"dhéanamh agus cuntas á bhunú agat. Is féidir an t-aicmiú a chasadh air agus "
"as i socruithe an chuntais ag am ar bith freisin."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:103
msgid "All inboxes"
msgstr "Gach bosca isteach"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:104
msgid ""
"All messages from all the accounts you have logged in, will be shown here "
"chronologically."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánfar gach teachtaireacht ó na cuntais go léir a logáil tú isteach "
"anseo go croineolaíoch."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:109
msgid "Account settings"
msgstr "Socruithe cuntas"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:110
msgid "Your account settings such as:"
msgstr "Do shocruithe cuntais ar nós:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:112
msgid "Aliases"
msgstr "Ailiasanna"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:113
msgid "Signature"
msgstr "Síniú"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:114
msgid "Default Folders"
msgstr "Fillteáin Réamhshocraithe"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:115
msgid "Autoresponder"
msgstr "Uathfhreagróir"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:116
msgid "Trusted senders"
msgstr "Seoltóirí iontaofa"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:117
msgid "..and more"
msgstr "..agus eile"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:119
msgid ""
"Can be found in the action menu of a mail account. There you can edit, add "
"or remove settings depending on your need."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir é a fháil sa roghchlár gníomhaíochta de chuntas ríomhphoist. Is "
"féidir leat socruithe a chur in eagar, a chur leis nó a bhaint ag brath ar "
"do riachtanas."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:122
msgid "Move messages to Junk folder"
msgstr "Bog teachtaireachtaí chuig an bhfillteán Dramhaíola"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:126
msgid ""
"Mail can move a message to a different folder when it is marked as junk."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le post teachtaireacht a aistriú go fillteán eile nuair a "
"mharcáiltear é mar dhramhphost."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:128 ../../groupware/mail.rst:176
#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:234
msgid "Visit Account settings"
msgstr "Tabhair cuairt ar shocruithe Cuntais"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:129
msgid "Go to Default folders"
msgstr "Téigh go dtí fillteáin Réamhshocraithe"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:130
msgid "Check that a folder is selected for the junk messages"
msgstr "Seiceáil go bhfuil fillteán roghnaithe do na dramhtheachtaireachtaí"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:131
msgid "Go to Junk settings"
msgstr "Téigh go dtí socruithe Junk"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:132
msgid "Click Move messages to Junk folder"
msgstr "Cliceáil Bog teachtaireachtaí chuig fillteán Junk"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:137
msgid "Refresh folder"
msgstr "Athnuachan fillteáin"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:139
msgid ""
"You can manually trigger a sync of your folder by clicking the refresh "
"button located at the top of the folder list. Starting from ``version 5.7`` "
"triggering the sync will also refresh the list of folders for the selected "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat sioncronú d’fhillteáin a thosú de láimh trí chliceáil ar an "
"gcnaipe athnuachana atá suite ag barr an liosta fillteán. Ó ``leagan 5.7`` "
"ar aghaidh, déanfaidh tús an tsioncronaithe liosta na bhfillteán don chuntas"
" roghnaithe a athnuachan freisin."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:143
msgid "Unified search"
msgstr "Cuardach aontaithe"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:145
msgid ""
"The Mail app integrates with Nextcloud's :ref:`unified search <unified-"
"search>` feature (see :doc:`../webinterface` for details). You can search "
"for emails across all your accounts using the search bar in the Nextcloud "
"header."
msgstr ""
"Comhtháthaíonn an aip Ríomhphoist le gné :ref:`unified search <unified-"
"search>` Nextcloud (féach :doc:`../webinterface` le haghaidh sonraí). Is "
"féidir leat ríomhphoist a chuardach ar fud do chuntais go léir ag baint "
"úsáide as an mbarra cuardaigh i gceanntásc Nextcloud."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:149
msgid ""
"Mail searches email subjects and sender/recipient fields. To search email "
"bodies, use the folder search feature in the app."
msgstr ""
"Déanann Mail cuardach i hábhair ríomhphoist agus sna réimsí don seoltóir nó "
"don fhaighteoir. Chun cuardach a dhéanamh i gcorp na ríomhphost, bain úsáid "
"as an ngné chuardaigh fillteán san aip."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:153
msgid "Search in folder"
msgstr "Cuardaigh i bhfillteán"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:155
msgid "Nextcloud 25 or newer"
msgstr "Nextcloud 25 nó níos nuaí"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:157
msgid ""
"At the top of the envelope list in any mail layout, there is a search field "
"shortcut for searching email subjects. Starting from ``version 3.7``, this "
"shortcut allows you to search by subject, recipient (to), or sender (from) "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"Ag barr an liosta clúdaigh in aon leagan amach ríomhphoist, tá aicearra "
"réimse cuardaigh chun ábhair ríomhphoist a chuardach. Ag tosú le ``leagan "
"3.7``, ceadaíonn an aicearra seo duit cuardach a dhéanamh de réir ábhair, "
"faighteoir (chuig), nó seoltóir (ó) de réir réamhshocraithe."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:161
msgid "Advanced search in folder"
msgstr "Cuardach casta i bhfillteán"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:165
msgid ""
"You can access our advanced search feature through a modal located at the "
"end of the search shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat ár ngné ardchuardaigh a rochtain trí mhodh atá suite ag "
"deireadh an aicearra cuardaigh."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:168 ../../groupware/mail.rst:178
msgid "Enable mail body search"
msgstr "Cumasaigh cuardach coirp poist"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:172
msgid ""
"Mail bodies can now be searched, this feature is opt-in because of potential"
" performance issues."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir comhlachtaí poist a chuardach anois, tá rogha an diúltaithe sa "
"ghné seo mar gheall ar cheisteanna feidhmíochta féideartha."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:174
msgid "To enable it:"
msgstr "Chun é a chumasú:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:177
msgid "Go to Folder search"
msgstr "Téigh chuig cuardach fillteán"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:180
msgid ""
"If you want to also enable it for unified folders you have to do so in Mail "
"settings"
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat é a chumasú do fhillteáin aontaithe chomh maith, caithfidh tú "
"é sin a dhéanamh i socruithe an Phoist"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:182
msgid ""
"By enabling it the main search box will now search in both subjects and mail"
" bodies, and a separate *Body* option will appear in advanced search."
msgstr ""
"Trí é a chumasú déanfaidh an príomhbhosca cuardaigh cuardach anois in ábhair"
" agus i gcomhlachtaí poist, agus beidh rogha *Comhlacht* ar leith le "
"feiceáil san ardchuardach."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:186
msgid "Account delegation"
msgstr "Tarmligean cuntais"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:188
msgid ""
"The app supports two ways of letting one user act on behalf of another's "
"mail account."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn an aip le dhá bhealach a ligeann d’úsáideoir amháin gníomhú thar "
"ceann chuntas ríomhphoist úsáideora eile."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:191
msgid "Sending as another address (server alias)"
msgstr "Á sheoladh mar sheoladh eile (ailias freastalaí)"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:193
msgid "This lets you send emails from the address of another account."
msgstr "Ligeann sé seo duit ríomhphoist a sheoladh ó sheoladh cuntais eile."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:195
msgid "The delegation has to be configured on the mail server by an admin"
msgstr ""
"Ní mór don riarthóir an tarmligean a chumrú ar an bhfreastalaí ríomhphoist"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:196
msgid "Add the other email address as an alias for your own email account"
msgstr ""
"Cuir an seoladh ríomhphoist eile leis mar ailias do do chuntas ríomhphoist "
"féin"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:197
msgid "When sending an email, select the alias as sender"
msgstr "Agus ríomhphost á sheoladh, roghnaigh an ailias mar sheoltóir"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:199
msgid ""
"The sent email might not be visible to the original account if it's stored "
"in your personal *Sent* folder."
msgstr ""
"D’fhéadfadh sé nach mbeadh an ríomhphost a seoladh le feiceáil sa "
"bhunchuntas má tá sé stóráilte i d’fhillteán pearsanta *Seolta*."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:202
msgid "Native account delegation"
msgstr "Tarmligean cuntais dúchais"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:204
msgid "Nextcloud Mail"
msgstr "Ríomhphost Nextcloud"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:206
msgid ""
"Native account delegation lets you grant other Nextcloud users access to one"
" of your mail accounts directly from the app, without any server-side alias "
"configuration. A delegate can do everything the account owner can — send, "
"receive, and delete mail on your behalf — except deleting the account or "
"updating its authentication information."
msgstr ""
"Trí ghné dhúchasach an chórais, is féidir leat rochtain ar cheann de do "
"chuntais ríomhphoist a thabhairt d’úsáideoirí Nextcloud eile go díreach ón "
"aip, gan gá le haon chumraíocht ailias ar thaobh an fhreastalaí. Is féidir "
"leis an duine a fhaigheann an rochtain gach rud a dhéanamh ar féidir le "
"húinéir an chuntais a dhéanamh — ríomhphoist a sheoladh, a fháil, agus a "
"scriosadh thar do cheann — ach amháin an cuntas a scriosadh nó a chuid "
"sonraí fíordheimhnithe a nuashonrú."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:210
msgid "To delegate one of your accounts:"
msgstr "Chun ceann de do chuntais a shannadh:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:212
msgid "Open the account's three-dot menu and select **Delegate account**"
msgstr ""
"Oscail roghchlár na dtrí phonc don chuntas agus roghnaigh **Tarmlig cuntas**"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:213
msgid "In the **Delegation** dialog, click **Add delegate**"
msgstr "Sa dialóg **Tarmligean**, cliceáil **Cuir ionadaí leis**"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:214
msgid ""
"Use the **Select a user** field to choose the Nextcloud user you want to "
"grant access to"
msgstr ""
"Úsáid an réimse **Roghnaigh úsáideoir** chun an t-úsáideoir Nextcloud a "
"roghnú ar mian leat rochtain a thabhairt dó"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:215
msgid "Confirm with **Delegate access**"
msgstr "Deimhnigh le **Rochtain ionadaí**"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:217
msgid ""
"The shared account then appears in the delegate's account list, marked as "
"delegated."
msgstr ""
"Ansin, feictear an cuntas comhroinnte i liosta cuntas an ionadaí, agus é "
"marcáilte mar chuntas a bhfuil ionadaíocht curtha ar bun dó."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:219
msgid "To remove access:"
msgstr "Chun rochtain a bhaint:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:221
msgid "Open the **Delegate account** dialog again"
msgstr "Oscail an bosca dialóige **Cuntas toscaire** arís"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:222
msgid "Click **Revoke** next to the delegate you want to remove"
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil **Cúlghairm** in aice leis an ionadaí ar mian leat é a bhaint"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:223
msgid "Confirm with **Revoke access**"
msgstr "Deimhnigh le **Cúlghairm rochtana**"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:225
msgid "Provisioned accounts cannot be delegated."
msgstr "Ní féidir cuntais sholáthraithe a shannadh."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:228
msgid "Automatic trash deletion"
msgstr "Bruscar a scriosadh go huathoibríoch"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:232
msgid ""
"The Mail app can automatically delete messages in the trash folder after a "
"certain number of days."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis an app Mail teachtaireachtaí a scriosadh go huathoibríoch sa "
"fhillteán bruscar tar éis roinnt laethanta áirithe."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:235
msgid "Go to Automatic trash deletion"
msgstr "Téigh go dtí Scriosadh Bruscar Uathoibríoch"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:236
msgid "Enter the number of days after which messages should be deleted"
msgstr ""
"Cuir isteach an líon laethanta ina dhiaidh sin ba cheart teachtaireachtaí a "
"scriosadh"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:238
msgid "Disable trash retention by leaving the field empty or setting it to 0."
msgstr ""
"Díchumasaigh coinneáil bruscair tríd an bpáirc a fhágáil folamh nó é a "
"shocrú go 0."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:240
msgid "Only mails deleted after enabling trash retention will be processed."
msgstr ""
"Ní phróiseálfar ach ríomhphoist a scriostar tar éis coinneáil bruscair a "
"chumasú."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:245
msgid "Compose messages"
msgstr "Teachtaireachtaí a chumadh"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:248
msgid "Start writing your message"
msgstr "Tosaigh ag scríobh do theachtaireacht"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:251
msgid "Minimize the composer modal"
msgstr "Íoslaghdaigh modúl an chumadóra"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:255
msgid ""
"The composer modal can be minimized while writing a new message, editing an "
"existing draft or a message from the outbox. Simply click the **Minimize** "
"button on the modal or click anywhere outside the modal."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an fhuinneog chumtha a íoslaghdú agus teachtaireacht nua á "
"scríobh, nó agus dréacht atá ann cheana nó teachtaireacht ón mbosca amach á "
"cur in eagar. Ní gá ach cliceáil ar an gcnaipe **Íoslaghdaigh** ar an "
"bhfuinneog, nó cliceáil áit ar bith lasmuigh den fhuinneog."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:259
msgid ""
"You can resume your minimized message by clicking anywhere on the minimized "
"composer indicator."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat leanúint ar aghaidh leis an teachtaireacht atá íoslaghdaithe "
"agat trí chliceáil áit ar bith ar an táscaire don eagarthóir "
"teachtaireachtaí íoslaghdaithe."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:263
msgid ""
"Press the **Close** button on the modal or on the minimized composer "
"indicator to stop editing a message. A draft will be saved automatically "
"into your draft folder."
msgstr ""
"Brúigh an cnaipe **Dún** ar an bhfuinneog aníos nó ar an táscaire don "
"fhuinneog chumtha íoslaghdaithe chun stop a chur le heagar a chur ar "
"theachtaireacht. Sábhálfar dréacht go huathoibríoch i d’fhillteán dréachtaí."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:267
msgid "Recipient info on composer"
msgstr "Eolas faighteoir faoin gcumadóir"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:271
msgid ""
"When you add your first recipient or contact in the \"To\" field, a right "
"pane will appear displaying the saved profile details of that contact. "
"Adding a second contact will collapse the list, allowing you to select and "
"expand any contact you added to view their details. If you prefer to focus "
"solely on writing in the composer, you can hide the right pane by clicking "
"the **Expand** icon in the composer toolbar. To show the right pane again, "
"simply click the **Minimize** icon in the same toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a chuireann tú do chéad fhaighteoir nó teagmhálaí leis an réimse "
"\"Chuig\", feicfear painéal ar dheis ina mbeidh sonraí próifíle sábháilte an"
" teagmhálaí sin le feiceáil. Má chuireann tú dara teagmhálaí leis, laghdófar"
" an liosta, rud a ligfidh duit aon teagmhálaí a chuir tú leis a roghnú agus "
"a leathnú chun a sonraí a fheiceáil. Más fearr leat díriú go hiomlán ar "
"scríobh sa chumadóir, is féidir leat an painéal ar dheis a cheilt trí "
"chliceáil ar an deilbhín **Leathnaigh** sa bharra uirlisí cumadóir. Chun an "
"painéal ar dheis a thaispeáint arís, cliceáil ar an deilbhín "
"**Íoslaghdaigh** sa bharra uirlisí céanna."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:277
msgid "Mention contacts"
msgstr "Luaigh teagmhálaithe"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:281
msgid ""
"You can mention contacts in your message by typing ``@`` and then selecting "
"the contact from the list. By doing so the contact will be automatically "
"added as a recipient."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat teagmhálaithe a lua i do theachtaireacht trí ``@`` a "
"chlóscríobh agus ansin an teagmhálaí a roghnú ón liosta. Trí seo a dhéanamh "
"cuirfear an teagmhálaí leis go huathoibríoch mar fhaighteoir."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:284
msgid "Only contacts with a valid email address will be suggested."
msgstr "Ní mholtar ach teagmhálaithe a bhfuil seoladh ríomhphoist bailí acu."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:287
msgid "Text blocks"
msgstr "Bloic téacs"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:291
msgid ""
"Text blocks are predefined snippets of text that can be inserted into your "
"email. They can be created and managed in the mail settings. They can be "
"inserted into the composer by typing ``!`` and then selecting the block from"
" the list or from the composer actions. Text blocks can be shared with users"
" and user groups."
msgstr ""
"Is píosaí téacs réamhshainithe iad bloic téacs is féidir a chur isteach i do"
" ríomhphost. Is féidir iad a chruthú agus a bhainistiú i socruithe an "
"ríomhphoist. Is féidir iad a chur isteach sa chumadóir trí ``!`` a "
"chlóscríobh agus ansin an bloc a roghnú ón liosta nó ó ghníomhartha an "
"chumadóra. Is féidir bloic téacs a roinnt le húsáideoirí agus le grúpaí "
"úsáideoirí."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:296
msgid "Outbox"
msgstr "Bosca Amach"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:298
msgid ""
"When a message has been composed and the \"Send\" button was clicked, the "
"message is added to the **Outbox**, which appears at the bottom of the left "
"sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn teachtaireacht cumtha agus an cnaipe \"Seol\" brúite, "
"cuirtear an teachtaireacht leis an **Bosca Amach**, atá le feiceáil ag bun "
"an bharra taoibh ar chlé."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:300
msgid ""
"You can also set the date and time for the send operation to a point in the "
"future (see :ref:`Scheduled messages <mail-scheduled-messages>`)- the "
"message will be kept in the outbox until your chosen date and time arrives, "
"then it will be sent automatically."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat freisin an dáta agus an t-am don oibríocht seolta a shocrú go"
" pointe sa todhchaí (féach :tag:`Teachtaireachtaí sceidealta <mail-"
"scheduled-messages>`) - coinneofar an teachtaireacht sa bhosca amach go dtí "
"go dtiocfaidh an dáta agus an t-am roghnaithe agat, ansin seolfar go "
"huathoibríoch í."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:302
msgid ""
"The outbox is only visible when there is a message waiting to be handled by "
"the outbox."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhíonn an bosca amach le feiceáil ach amháin nuair a bhíonn "
"teachtaireacht ag fanacht le láimhseáil ag an mbosca amach."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:304
msgid ""
"You can reopen the composer for a message in the outbox any time before the "
"send operation is triggered."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat an t-eagarthóir teachtaireachtaí a oscailt arís le haghaidh "
"teachtaireachta atá sa bhosca amach, tráth ar bith sula gcuirtear an "
"próiseas seolta i ngníomh."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:307
msgid ""
"When an error occurs during sending, three error messages are possible:"
msgstr ""
"Nuair a tharlaíonn earráid le linn seolta, is féidir trí theachtaireacht "
"earráide:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:309
msgid "Could not copy to \"Sent\" folder"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir cóipeáil chuig an bhfillteán \"Seolta\""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:310
msgid ""
"The mail was sent but couldn't be copied to the \"Sent\" folder. This error "
"will be handled by the outbox and the copy operation will be tried again."
msgstr ""
"Seoladh an ríomhphost ach níorbh fhéidir cóip de a chur sa bhfillteán "
"\"Seolta\". Láimhseálfaidh an bosca amach an earráid seo agus déanfar "
"iarracht arís an chóip a chruthú."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:311
msgid "Mail server error"
msgstr "Earráid freastalaí ríomhphoist"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:312
msgid ""
"Sending was unsuccessful with a state that can be retried (ex: the SMTP "
"server couldn't be reached). The outbox will retry sending the message."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar an seoladh, ach is féidir iarracht eile a dhéanamh (m.sh. níorbh "
"fhéidir teagmháil a dhéanamh leis an bhfreastalaí SMTP). Déanfaidh an bosca "
"amach iarracht eile an teachtaireacht a sheoladh."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:313
msgid "Message could not be sent"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an teachtaireacht a sheoladh"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:314
msgid ""
"Sending might or might not have failed. The mail server can't tell us the "
"state of the message. Since the Mail app has no way to determine the state "
"of the message (sent or unsent) the message will stay in the outbox and the "
"account user has to decide how to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Seans gur theip nó nár theip ar an seoladh. Ní féidir leis an bhfreastalaí "
"ríomhphoist staid na teachtaireachta a insint dúinn. Ós rud é nach bhfuil "
"aon bhealach ag an aip Mail chun staid na teachtaireachta a chinneadh "
"(seolta nó nár seoladh) fanfaidh an teachtaireacht sa bhosca amach agus "
"caithfidh úsáideoir an chuntais cinneadh a dhéanamh conas dul ar aghaidh."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:318
msgid "Folder actions"
msgstr "Gníomhartha fillteáin"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:321
msgid "Add a folder"
msgstr "Cuir fillteán leis"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:322
msgid "Open the action menu of an account"
msgstr "Oscail an roghchlár gníomhaíochta de chuntas"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:323
msgid "Click add folder"
msgstr "Cliceáil cuir fillteán leis"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:326
msgid "Add a subfolder"
msgstr "Cuir fo-fhillteán leis"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:327
msgid "Open the action menu of a folder"
msgstr "Oscail roghchlár gníomhaíochta fillteáin"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:328
msgid "Click add subfolder"
msgstr "Cliceáil cuir fo-fhillteán leis"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:331
msgid "Shared folder"
msgstr "Fillteán comhroinnte"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:332
msgid ""
"If a folder was shared with you with some specific rights, that folder will "
"show as a new folder with a shared icon as below:"
msgstr ""
"Má roinneadh fillteán leat le cearta áirithe, beidh an fillteán sin le "
"feiceáil mar fhillteán nua a bhfuil deilbhín comhroinnte air, mar a "
"thaispeántar thíos:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:337
msgid "Envelope actions"
msgstr "Gníomhartha clúdaigh"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:340
msgid "Create an event"
msgstr "Cruthaigh imeacht"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:341
msgid "Create an event for a certain message/thread directly via mail app"
msgstr ""
"Cruthaigh imeacht le haghaidh teachtaireacht / snáithe áirithe go díreach "
"tríd an aip ríomhphoist"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:343 ../../groupware/mail.rst:356
#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:364
msgid "Open action menu of an envelope"
msgstr "Oscail roghchlár gníomhaíochta an chlúdaigh"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:344
msgid "Click *More actions*"
msgstr "Cliceáil *Tuilleadh gníomhartha*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:345
msgid "Click *Create event*"
msgstr "Cliceáil *Cruthaigh imeacht*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:347
msgid ""
"An event title and agenda are created for you if the administrator has "
"enabled it."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaítear teideal imeachta agus clár oibre duit má tá sé sin cumasaithe ag"
" an riarthóir."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:350
msgid "Create a task"
msgstr "Cruthaigh tasc"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:354
msgid "Create an task for a certain message/thread directly via mail app"
msgstr ""
"Cruthaigh tasc le haghaidh teachtaireacht / snáithe áirithe go díreach tríd "
"an aip ríomhphoist"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:357
msgid "Click *more actions*"
msgstr "Cliceáil *tuilleadh gníomhartha*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:358
msgid "Click *create task*"
msgstr "Cliceáil *cruthaigh tasc*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:360
msgid ""
"Tasks are stored in supported calendars. If there is no compatible calendar "
"you can create a new one with the :ref:`calendar app<calendar-app>`."
msgstr ""
"Stóráiltear tascanna i bhféilirí tacaithe. Mura bhfuil aon fhéilire "
"comhoiriúnach ann is féidir leat ceann nua a chruthú leis an :ref:`calendar "
"app<calendar-app>`."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:363
msgid "Edit tags"
msgstr "Cuir clibeanna in eagar"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:365
msgid "Click *Edit tags*"
msgstr "Cliceáil *Cuir clibeanna in eagar*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:366
msgid "On the tags modal, set/unset tags"
msgstr "Ar mhodúil na gclibeanna, socraigh/díshocraigh clibeanna"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:369
msgid "Change color for tags"
msgstr "Athraigh dath le haghaidh clibeanna"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:375
msgid ""
"Upon creating a tag, a randomly assigned color is automatically chosen. Once"
" the tag is saved, you have the flexibility to customize its color according"
" to your preferences. This feature can be found on the Tag modal action "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a chruthaítear clib, roghnaítear dath a shanntar go randamach go "
"huathoibríoch. Nuair a bheidh an chlib sábháilte, tá an tsolúbthacht agat "
"chun a dath a shaincheapadh de réir do chuid sainroghanna. Is féidir an ghné"
" seo a fháil ar an roghchlár gníomhaíochta módúil Clib."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:378
msgid "Delete tags"
msgstr "Scrios clibeanna"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:384
msgid ""
"You now have the ability to delete tags that you have previously created. To"
" access this feature:"
msgstr ""
"Tá an cumas agat anois clibeanna a chruthaigh tú roimhe seo a scriosadh. "
"Chun an ghné seo a rochtain:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:386
msgid "Open the action menu of an envelope/thread."
msgstr "Oscail an roghchlár gníomhaíochta de chlúdach / snáithe."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:387
msgid "Select Edit tags."
msgstr "Roghnaigh Cuir na clibeanna in eagar."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:388
msgid ""
"Within the tags modal, open the action menu for the specific tag you wish to"
" delete."
msgstr ""
"Laistigh den mhodh clibeanna, oscail an roghchlár gníomhaíochta don chlib "
"shonrach is mian leat a scriosadh."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:390
msgid ""
"Please note that default tags such as Work, To do, Personal, and Later "
"cannot be deleted, they can only be renamed."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara nach féidir clibeanna réamhshocraithe ar nós Obair, Le "
"Déanamh, Pearsanta agus Níos Déanaí a scriosadh, ní féidir ach iad a "
"athainmniú."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:393
msgid "AI summary"
msgstr "Achoimre AI"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:397
msgid ""
"When looking through your folder you will see a short AI generated summary "
"of your emails as a preview."
msgstr ""
"Agus tú ag breathnú trí d’fhillteán, feicfidh tú achoimre ghearr ar do "
"ríomhphoist, ginte ag hintleacht shaorga, mar réamhamharc."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:399 ../../groupware/mail.rst:440
#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:462
msgid "Please note that the feature has to be enabled by the administrator"
msgstr "Tabhair faoi deara go gcaithfidh an riarthóir an ghné a chumasú"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:402
msgid "Quick actions"
msgstr "Gníomhartha tapa"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:405
msgid ""
"Allows you to group action steps that you would normally perform on "
"envelopes such as tagging, moving, marking as read ... into quick actions "
"that can be executed with a single click. Quick actions are scoped to one "
"mail account and can be created and managed in the mail settings under "
"\"Quick actions\" or directly from the envelope action menu."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann sé seo duit céimeanna gníomhaíochta a dhéanfá de ghnáth ar chlúdaigh"
" amhail clibeáil, bogadh, marcáil mar léite ... a ghrúpáil i ngníomhartha "
"tapa is féidir a fhorghníomhú le cliceáil amháin. Tá gníomhartha tapa "
"teoranta do chuntas ríomhphoist amháin agus is féidir iad a chruthú agus a "
"bhainistiú sna socruithe ríomhphoist faoi \"Gníomhartha tapa\" nó go díreach"
" ón roghchlár gníomhaíochta clúdaigh."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:408
msgid ""
"Some action steps such as `Mark as spam`, `Move thread` and `Delete thread` "
"are mutually exclusive and cannot be part of the same quick action, they "
"also can't be re-ordered and will always be executed last."
msgstr ""
"Tá roinnt céimeanna gníomhaíochta amhail ‘Marcáil mar thurscar’, ‘Bog "
"snáithe’ agus ‘Scrios snáithe’ eisiach dá chéile agus ní féidir leo a bheith"
" mar chuid den ghníomh tapa céanna, ní féidir iad a athordú ach an oiread "
"agus déanfar iad a fhorghníomhú i gcónaí sa deireadh."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:410
msgid ""
"Please note that quick actions will be performed on all messages in a thread"
" when executed on one."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara le do thoil go ndéanfar gníomhartha tapa ar gach "
"teachtaireacht i snáithe nuair a dhéantar iad a fhorghníomhú ar cheann acu."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:413
msgid "Message actions"
msgstr "Gníomhartha teachtaireachta"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:416
msgid "Unsubscribe from a mailing list"
msgstr "Díliostáil ó liosta seoltaí"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:420
msgid ""
"Some mailing lists and newsletters allow to be unsubscribed easily. If the "
"Mail app detects messages from such a sender, it will show an *Unsubscribe* "
"button next to the sender information. Click and confirm to unsubscribe from"
" the list."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann roinnt liostaí seoltaí agus nuachtlitreacha díliostáil go héasca. Má"
" bhraitheann an aip Mail teachtaireachtaí ó sheoltóir den sórt sin, "
"taispeánfaidh sé cnaipe *Díliostáil* in aice le faisnéis an tseoltóra. "
"Cliceáil agus deimhnigh chun díliostáil ón liosta."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:423
msgid "Snooze"
msgstr "Cur ar suan"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:427
msgid ""
"Snoozing a message or thread moves it into a dedicated folder until the "
"selected snooze date is reached and the message or thread is moved back to "
"the original folder."
msgstr ""
"Má chuireann tú teachtaireacht nó snáithe ar sos, aistrítear chuig fillteán "
"tiomnaithe í nó é go dtí go sroichtear an dáta a roghnaíodh don sos; ansin, "
"aistrítear an teachtaireacht nó an snáithe ar ais chuig an bhfillteán "
"bunaidh."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:429
msgid "Open action menu of an envelope or thread"
msgstr "Oscail roghchlár gníomhaíochta clúdach litreach nó snáithe"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:430
msgid "Click *Snooze*"
msgstr "Cliceáil *Snooze*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:431
msgid "Select how long the message or thread should be snoozed"
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh cá fhad ar cheart an teachtaireacht nó an snáithe a chur ar suan"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:434
msgid "Smart replies"
msgstr "Freagraí cliste"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:438
msgid ""
"When you open a message in the Mail app, it proposes AI-generated replies. "
"By simply clicking on a suggested reply, the composer opens with the "
"response pre-filled."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a osclaíonn tú teachtaireacht san aip Mail, molann sé freagraí a "
"ghintear le AI. Trí chliceáil ar fhreagra molta, osclaíonn an cumadóir agus "
"an freagra réamhlíonta."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:442
msgid "Supported languages depend on the used large language model"
msgstr ""
"Braitheann teangacha a dtacaítear leo ar an múnla mór teangacha a úsáidtear"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:445
msgid "Mail translation"
msgstr "Aistriúchán ríomhphoist"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:449
msgid ""
"You are able to translate messages to your configured languages similarly to"
" Talk."
msgstr ""
"Tá tú in ann teachtaireachtaí a aistriú chuig do theangacha cumraithe mar an"
" gcéanna le Talk."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:451
msgid "Please note that translation features have to be enabled on the server"
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara go gcaithfidh gnéithe aistriúcháin a bheith cumasaithe ar"
" an bhfreastalaí"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:453
msgid ""
"Since version 5.3, if LLM is enabled by admin, translations will be "
"suggested"
msgstr ""
"Ó leagan 5.3, má tá LLM cumasaithe ag an riarthóir, molfar aistriúcháin"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:456
msgid "Thread summary"
msgstr "Achoimre snáithe"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:458
msgid ""
"The mail app supports summarizing message threads that contain 3 or more "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn an aip ríomhphoist le snáitheanna teachtaireachta a achoimriú ina "
"bhfuil 3 theachtaireacht nó níos mó."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:464
msgid ""
"Please note that this feature only works well with integration_openai. Local"
" LLMs take too long to respond and the summary request is likely to time out"
" and still create significant system load."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara nach n-oibríonn an ghné seo ach go maith le "
"integration_openai. Tógann sé ró-fhada ar LLManna áitiúla freagra a "
"thabhairt agus is dócha go dtiocfaidh deireadh leis an iarratas achomair "
"agus go gcruthóidh sé ualach suntasach córais fós."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:467
msgid "Filtering and autoresponder"
msgstr "Scagadh agus uathfhreagróir"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:469
msgid ""
"The Mail app has a editor for Sieve scripts, an interface to configure "
"autoresponders and an interface to configure filters. Sieve has to be "
"enabled in the :ref:`account settings <mail-account-settings>`."
msgstr ""
"Tá eagarthóir ag an aip Mail le haghaidh scripteanna Sieve, comhéadan chun "
"uathfhreagróirí a chumrú agus comhéadan chun scagairí a chumrú. Ní mór "
"criathar a chumasú sna :ref:`socruithe cuntais <mail-account-settings>`."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:472
msgid "Autoresponders"
msgstr "Uathfhreagróirí"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:476
msgid ""
"The autoresponder is off by default. It can be set manually, or follow the "
"system settings. Following system settings means that the long absence "
"message entered on the :ref:`Absence settings section <groupware-absence>` "
"is applied automatically."
msgstr ""
"Tá an t-uathfhreagraí múchta de réir réamhshocraithe. Is féidir é a shocrú "
"de láimh, nó socruithe an chórais a leanúint. Nuair a leanann tú socruithe "
"an chórais, cuirtear an teachtaireacht asláithreachta fada a iontráladh ar "
"an :ref:`Socruithe Neamhláithreachta rannán <groupware-absence>` i bhfeidhm "
"go huathoibríoch."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:479
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Scagaire"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:483
msgid "Mail 4.1 includes a simple editor to configure filter rules."
msgstr "Cuimsíonn Mail 4.1 eagarthóir simplí chun rialacha scagaire a chumrú."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:486
msgid ""
"Importing existing filters is not supported. However, all existing filters "
"will remain active and unchanged.  We recommend backing up your current "
"script through the Sieve script editor as a precaution."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le hiompórtáil na scagairí atá ann cheana. Mar sin féin, "
"fanfaidh na scagairí atá ann cheana féin gníomhach agus gan athrú. Molaimid "
"tacaíocht a thabhairt do do script reatha tríd an eagarthóir scripte Sieve "
"mar réamhchúram."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:489
msgid "How to Add a New Filter"
msgstr "Conas Scagaire Nua a Chur Leis"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:491 ../../groupware/mail.rst:499
msgid "Open your account settings."
msgstr "Oscail do shocruithe cuntais."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:492
msgid ""
"Verify that Sieve is enabled for your account (see Sieve server settings)."
msgstr ""
"Fíoraigh go bhfuil Sieve cumasaithe do do chuntas (féach socruithe "
"freastalaí Sieve)."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:493 ../../groupware/mail.rst:501
msgid "Click on Filters."
msgstr "Cliceáil ar Scagairí."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:494
msgid "Select New Filter to create a new rule."
msgstr "Roghnaigh Scagaire Nua chun riail nua a chruthú."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:497
msgid "How to Delete a Filter"
msgstr "Conas Scagaire a Scriosadh"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:500
msgid ""
"Ensure that Sieve is enabled for your account (see Sieve server settings)."
msgstr ""
"Cinntigh go bhfuil Sieve cumasaithe do do chuntas (féach socruithe "
"freastalaí Sieve)."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:502
msgid "Hover over the filter you wish to delete, then click the trash icon."
msgstr ""
"Ainligh thar an scagaire is mian leat a scriosadh, ansin cliceáil ar an "
"deilbhín bruscar."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:506
msgid "Conditions"
msgstr "Coinníollacha"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:508
msgid ""
"Conditions are applied to incoming emails on your mail server, targeting "
"fields such as Subject, Sender, and Recipient. You can use the following "
"operators to define conditions for these fields:"
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear coinníollacha i bhfeidhm ar ríomhphoist isteach ar do fhreastalaí "
"ríomhphoist, ag díriú ar réimsí ar nós Ábhar, Seoltóir, agus Faighteoir. Is "
"féidir leat na hoibreoirí seo a leanas a úsáid chun coinníollacha a shainiú "
"do na réimsí seo:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:510
msgid ""
"**is exactly**: An exact match. The field must be identical to the provided "
"value."
msgstr ""
"**tá sé go díreach**: Meaitseáil chruinn. Ní mór don réimse a bheith "
"comhionann leis an luach a cuireadh ar fáil."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:511
msgid ""
"**contains**: A substring match. The field matches if the provided value is "
"contained within it. For example, \"report\" would match \"port\"."
msgstr ""
"**tá**: Cluiche fotheaghrán. Meaitseálann an réimse má tá an luach "
"soláthraithe istigh ann. Mar shampla, bheadh ​​\"tuairisc\" ag teacht le "
"\"port\"."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:512
msgid ""
"**matches**: A pattern match using wildcards. The \"*\" symbol represents "
"any number of characters (including none), while \"?\" represents exactly "
"one character. For example, \"*report*\" would match \"Business report "
"2024\"."
msgstr ""
"**meaitseanna**: Meaitseáil phatrúin ag baint úsáide as saoróga. Seasann an "
"tsiombail \"*\" d'aon líon carachtar (gan aon cheann san áireamh), agus "
"\"?\" is ionann é agus carachtar amháin. Mar shampla, bheadh "
"​​\"*tuairisc*\" ag teacht le \"Tuarascáil Gnó 2024\"."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:515
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Gníomhartha"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:517
msgid ""
"Actions are triggered when the specified tests are true. The following "
"actions are available:"
msgstr ""
"Spreagtar gníomhartha nuair a bhíonn na tástálacha sonraithe fíor. Tá na "
"gníomhartha seo a leanas ar fáil:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:519
msgid "**fileinto**: Moves the message into a specified folder."
msgstr ""
"**fileinto**: Bogtar an teachtaireacht isteach i bhfillteán sonraithe."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:520
msgid "**addflag**: Adds a flag to the message."
msgstr "**addflag**: Cuireann sé bratach leis an teachtaireacht."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:521
msgid ""
"**stop**: Halts the execution of the filter script. No further filters with "
"will be processed after this action."
msgstr ""
"**stop**: Cuireann sé seo stop le feidhmiú na scripte scagaire. Ní dhéanfar "
"aon scagairí eile a phróiseáil tar éis an ghnímh seo."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:524
msgid "Create a filter from a message"
msgstr "Cruthaigh scagaire ó theachtaireacht"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:528
msgid ""
"To create a filter from a given message, open the message and then open the "
"menu by clicking on the three dots. Next, click on \"More actions\" followed"
" by \"Create mail filter.\""
msgstr ""
"Chun scagaire a chruthú ó theachtaireacht ar leith, oscail an teachtaireacht"
" agus ansin oscail an roghchlár trí chliceáil ar na trí phonc. Ansin, "
"cliceáil ar \"Tuilleadh gníomhartha\" agus ansin \"Cruthaigh scagaire "
"ríomhphoist\"."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:530
msgid ""
"In the dialog, please select the conditions to match incoming messages and "
"continue by clicking on \"Create mail filter.\""
msgstr ""
"Sa dialóg, roghnaigh na coinníollacha chun teachtaireachtaí isteach a "
"mheaitseáil agus lean ar aghaidh trí chliceáil ar \"Cruthaigh scagaire "
"ríomhphoist\"."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:536
msgid "Follow-up reminders"
msgstr "Meabhrúcháin leantacha"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:540
msgid ""
"The Mail app will automatically remind you when an outgoing email did not "
"receive a response. Each sent email will be analyzed by an AI to check "
"whether a reply is expected. After four days all relevant emails will be "
"shown in your priority inbox."
msgstr ""
"Cuirfidh an aip Mail i gcuimhne duit go huathoibríoch nuair nach bhfuair "
"ríomhphost amach freagra. Déanfaidh AI anailís ar gach ríomhphost seolta "
"chun a sheiceáil an bhfuiltear ag súil le freagra. Tar éis ceithre lá "
"taispeánfar gach ríomhphost ábhartha i do bhosca tosaíochta."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:544
msgid ""
"When clicking on such an email a button will be shown to quickly follow up "
"with all recipients. It is also possible to disable follow-up reminders for "
"a sent email."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a chliceálann tú ar ríomhphost den sórt sin taispeánfar cnaipe chun na"
" faighteoirí go léir a leanúint go tapa. Is féidir freisin meabhrúcháin "
"leantacha a dhíchumasú le haghaidh ríomhphost seolta."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:547
msgid "Please note that the feature has to be enabled by the administrator."
msgstr "Tabhair faoi deara go gcaithfidh an riarthóir an ghné a chumasú."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:550
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Slándáil"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:553
msgid "Phishing detection"
msgstr "Brath fioscaireachta"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:557
msgid ""
"The Mail app will check for potential phishing attempts and will display a "
"warning to the user."
msgstr ""
"Seiceálfaidh an aip Mail le haghaidh iarrachtaí fioscaireachta féideartha "
"agus taispeánfaidh sé rabhadh don úsáideoir."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:559
msgid "The checks are the following:"
msgstr "Seo a leanas na seiceálacha:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:561
msgid ""
"The sender address saved in the addressbook is not the same as the one in "
"the mail account"
msgstr ""
"Níl an seoladh seoltóra atá sábháilte sa leabhar seoltaí mar an gcéanna leis"
" an seoladh sa chuntas ríomhphoist"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:562
msgid ""
"The sender is using a custom email address that doesn't match the from "
"address"
msgstr ""
"Tá seoladh ríomhphoist saincheaptha in úsáid ag an seoltóir nach bhfuil ag "
"teacht leis an seoladh ón seoladh"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:563
msgid "The sent date is set in the future"
msgstr "Socraítear an dáta seolta amach anseo"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:564
msgid "Links in the message body are not pointing to the displayed text"
msgstr ""
"Níl naisc i gcorp na teachtaireachta ag díriú ar an téacs atá ar taispeáint"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:565
msgid "The reply-to address is not the same as the sender address"
msgstr "Níl an seoladh freagartha mar an gcéanna leis an seoladh seoltóra"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:567
msgid ""
"Please note that the warning does not mean that the message is a phishing "
"attempt. It only means that the Mail app detected a potential phishing "
"attempt."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara le do thoil nach gciallaíonn an rabhadh gur iarracht "
"fioscaireachta atá sa teachtaireacht. Ní chiallaíonn sé ach gur bhraith an "
"app Mail iarracht fioscaireachta féideartha."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:570
msgid "Internal addresses"
msgstr "Seoltaí inmheánacha"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:574
msgid ""
"The Mail app allows adding internal addresses and domains, and will warn the"
" user if the address is not in the list, when sending and upon receiving a "
"message."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an app Mail seoltaí inmheánacha agus fearainn a chur leis, agus "
"tabharfaidh sé rabhadh don úsáideoir mura bhfuil an seoladh ar an liosta, "
"nuair a sheoltar agus nuair a fhaigheann sé teachtaireacht."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:576
msgid "To add an internal address:"
msgstr "Chun seoladh inmheánach a chur leis:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:578
msgid "Open the mail settings"
msgstr "Oscail na socruithe ríomhphoist"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:579
msgid "Navigate to Privacy and security section"
msgstr "Déan nascleanúint chuig an rannán Príobháideachta agus slándála"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:580
msgid "Enable the internal addresses by clicking on the checkbox"
msgstr "Cumasaigh na seoltaí inmheánacha trí chliceáil ar an ticbhosca"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:581
msgid "Click the Add internal address button"
msgstr "Cliceáil ar an gcnaipe Cuir seoladh inmheánach leis"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:582
msgid "Enter the address or domain and click Add"
msgstr "Cuir isteach an seoladh nó an fearann ​​agus cliceáil Cuir"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:585
msgid "Dashboard integration"
msgstr "Comhtháthú painéil"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:587
msgid "Nextcloud 20 or newer"
msgstr "Nextcloud 20 nó níos nuaí"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:589
msgid ""
"The mail app offers two widgets designed for integration with Nextcloud's "
"dashboard:"
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an aip ríomhphoist dhá ghiuirléid ar fáil atá deartha le haghaidh "
"comhtháthú le painéal Nextcloud:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:591
msgid "Unread mails: This widget displays unread emails."
msgstr ""
"Ríomhphoist neamhléite: Taispeánann an giuirléid seo ríomhphoist neamhléite."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:592
msgid ""
"Important mails: This widget shows emails that have been flagged as "
"important."
msgstr ""
"Ríomhphoist thábhachtacha: Taispeánann an giuirléid seo ríomhphoist atá "
"marcáilte mar thábhachtach."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:594
msgid ""
"These widgets utilize the emails from the email accounts that are set up for"
" your account."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann na giuirléidí seo na ríomhphoist ó na cuntais ríomhphoist atá "
"socraithe do do chuntas."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:597
msgid "Calendar integration"
msgstr "Comhtháthú féilire"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:599
msgid ""
"The Mail app integrates with the Calendar app to help you manage meeting "
"invitations and keep your calendar up to date."
msgstr ""
"Comhtháthaíonn an aip Ríomhphoist leis an aip Féilire chun cabhrú leat "
"cuireadh chuig cruinnithe a bhainistiú agus do fhéilire a choinneáil cothrom"
" le dáta."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:602
msgid "Meeting invitations"
msgstr "Cuirí cruinnithe"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:604
msgid ""
"When you receive a message containing a meeting invitation, the Mail app "
"automatically detects the attached calendar file and displays a formatted "
"action section to help you respond."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a fhaigheann tú teachtaireacht ina bhfuil cuireadh chuig cruinniú, "
"braitheann an aip Ríomhphoist an comhad féilire atá ceangailte go "
"huathoibríoch agus taispeánann sé rannóg gníomhaíochta formáidithe chun "
"cabhrú leat freagairt."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:606
msgid "You can:"
msgstr "Is féidir leat:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:608
msgid "**Accept** the invitation"
msgstr "**Glac leis** an cuireadh"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:609
msgid "**Decline** the invitation"
msgstr "**Diúltaigh** don chuireadh"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:610
msgid "**Tentatively accept** the invitation"
msgstr "**Glac leis an gcuireadh go sealadach**"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:612
msgid ""
"Your response is sent directly from the Mail app, and the event is added to "
"your primary calendar accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Seoltar do fhreagra go díreach ón aip Ríomhphoist, agus cuirtear an ócáid "
"​​le do phríomhfhéilire dá réir."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:614
msgid "You can also manually add a meeting invitation to a specific calendar:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat cuireadh cruinnithe a chur le féilire ar leith de láimh "
"freisin:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:616
msgid "Open the message with the meeting invitation"
msgstr "Oscail an teachtaireacht leis an gcuireadh chuig an gcruinniú"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:617
msgid "Scroll to the bottom of the message to the attachments section"
msgstr "Scrollaigh go bun an teachtaireachta go dtí an chuid ceangaltán"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:618
msgid ""
"Select the calendar file (usually with a .ics extension), then click the "
"three dots menu."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an comhad féilire (de ghnáth le síneadh .ics), ansin cliceáil ar "
"an roghchlár trí phointe."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:619
msgid "Click \"Import in to calendar\" and choose the desired calendar."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil \"Iompórtáil isteach sa fhéilire\" agus roghnaigh an féilire atá "
"uait."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:622
msgid "Meeting invitation automation"
msgstr "Uathoibriú cuireadh cruinnithe"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:624
msgid ""
"When a meeting organizer sends updates to an existing event (such as time "
"changes or location updates), the Mail app processes these automatically and"
" updates the corresponding event in your calendar."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a sheolann eagraí cruinnithe nuashonruithe chuig imeacht atá ann "
"cheana féin (amhail athruithe ama nó nuashonruithe suímh), próiseálann an "
"aip Mail iad seo go huathoibríoch agus déanann sé an t-imeacht "
"comhfhreagrach i do fhéilire a nuashonrú."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:628
msgid ""
"You can also configure Mail to automatically add all new meeting invitations"
" to your calendar without requiring manual acceptance. The invitations will "
"be added to the calendar as tentative."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat Mail a chumrú freisin chun gach cuireadh nua do chruinnithe a"
" chur le do fhéilire go huathoibríoch gan gá le glacadh leo de láimh. "
"Cuirfear na cuireadh leis an bhféilire mar chuireadh sealadach."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:630
msgid "To enable this feature:"
msgstr "Chun an ghné seo a chumasú:"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:632
msgid "Visit account settings of a specific mail account"
msgstr "Tabhair cuairt ar shocruithe cuntais chuntais ríomhphoist ar leith"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:633
msgid "Navigate to Calendar settings section"
msgstr "Téigh go dtí an rannán socruithe Féilire"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:634
msgid "Enable *Automatically create tentative appointments in calendar*"
msgstr "Cumasaigh *Cruthaigh coinní sealadacha go huathoibríoch sa fhéilire*"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:636
msgid ""
"With this setting enabled, invitations will still appear in your mail list, "
"but they will be automatically added to your calendar."
msgstr ""
"Agus an socrú seo cumasaithe, beidh cuireadh fós le feiceáil i do liosta "
"ríomhphoist, ach cuirfear le do fhéilire iad go huathoibríoch."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:639
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Aicearraí méarchláir"

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:641
msgid ""
"The Mail app implements several keyboard shortcuts to speed up your "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an aip Mail roinnt aicearraí méarchláir i bhfeidhm chun "
"d’eispéireas a bhrostú."

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:643
msgid ""
"For a full list of the supported shortcuts, check out the Mail settings in "
"your instance."
msgstr ""
"Chun liosta iomlán de na haicearraí a dtacaítear leo a fheiceáil, féach ar "
"shocruithe an Phoist i do chás féin."
